{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Player QQ Group:</strong>\u00a0972076310</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/00b026132f67936df1d262fecad293eb.avif?t=1753755195\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/d5ec7884de77301c391167f8a9f0cbc5.poster.avif?t=1753755195\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/d5ec7884de77301c391167f8a9f0cbc5.webm?t=1753755195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/d5ec7884de77301c391167f8a9f0cbc5.mp4?t=1753755195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-Based Tactical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Plan Every Move:</strong>\u00a0On classic square\u001egrid battlefields, every Action Point matters. Exploit terrain, synergize buffs and debuffs, and unleash high\u001eimpact combos to outmaneuver savage pirate mutants, ancient war machines, and eldritch horrors.<br>\u25cf <strong>24 Unique Classes &amp; 200+ Skills:</strong>\u00a0Mix and match active skills, unlock connected passives, and watch your build evolve\u2014whether you\u2019re forging a frontline juggernaut or a glass\u001ecannon sniper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/872dcfae076628a19f3f3bae41120c5a.poster.avif?t=1753755195\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/872dcfae076628a19f3f3bae41120c5a.webm?t=1753755195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/872dcfae076628a19f3f3bae41120c5a.mp4?t=1753755195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relentless Loot &amp; Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Procedural Gear Drops:</strong>\u00a0Raid chests, loot defeated foes, and trade in black\u001emarket ports to collect weapons, armor, tools, and mech parts\u2014each with randomized stats and mechanics.<br>\u25cf <strong>Build Your Dream Squad:</strong>\u00a0Equip your heroes and mechs with complementary relics and gear to create lethal synergies tailored to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/9fcacd6e16323cbd583a8f50e0d11598.poster.avif?t=1753755195\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/9fcacd6e16323cbd583a8f50e0d11598.webm?t=1753755195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/9fcacd6e16323cbd583a8f50e0d11598.mp4?t=1753755195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mech-Scale Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf <strong>Call Down the Big Guns:</strong>\u00a0When enemies swarm, summon your assault mech\u2014its landing AOE and devastating abilities can turn the tide in your favor. Perfect timing is everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/a136691824b4cc5069f706c62456ac03.poster.avif?t=1753755195\" width=600 hei