s against the Abyss.<br>\u25cf <strong>Face Diverse Threats:</strong>\u00a0From grimy pirate dens and treacherous ruins to stinking monster lairs, you\u2019ll confront over 50 enemy types\u2014each demanding fresh tactics to survive and prevail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/12db8e79d03a7a8d7b6c1ab250f5c5fe.poster.avif?t=1753755195\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/12db8e79d03a7a8d7b6c1ab250f5c5fe.webm?t=1753755195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/12db8e79d03a7a8d7b6c1ab250f5c5fe.mp4?t=1753755195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/afd84f017a4577d713c91d0f95a693d8.poster.avif?t=1753755195\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/afd84f017a4577d713c91d0f95a693d8.webm?t=1753755195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/extras/afd84f017a4577d713c91d0f95a693d8.mp4?t=1753755195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step aboard, commander\u2014your last stand against the abyss begins now!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855320?t=1753755195","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855320?t=1753755195","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855320/9e4141e21d38901b093cc39905b876d17b